        <ExplanationTxt>UNITE MEMBERS INTO ONE ORGANIZATION FOR THE PURPOSE OF IMPROVING ECONOMIC ADVANTAGES THROUGH COLLECTIVE BARGAINING AND TO PROMOTE THE SOCIAL AWARENESS OF ITS MEMBERSHIP.</ExplanationTxt>
