        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART VI, LINES 6-7:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE VOTING MEMBERS OF THE LOCAL UNION ARE ACTIVE MEMBERS WHO PAY FULL DUES. THESE MEMBERS ELECT THE MEMBERS OF THE GOVERNING BODY AND APPROVE SIGNIFICANT DECISIONS OF THE GOVERNING BODY.</ExplanationTxt>
