      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART VI, LINE 8b:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE LOCAL UNION DOES NOT HAVE ANY COMMITTEES WITH AUTHORITY TO ACT ON BEHALF OF THE GOVERNING BODY.</ExplanationTxt>
